=== REASONING ===
1. COMMON_TIMEZONES: Used superset from TriggerConfigurator (11 entries including Paris, Shanghai)
2. DAYS: Canonical Sun-start array; replaces both DAYS and DAY_LABELS where semantics match
3. TIME_RANGE_PRESETS: Superset of 5 items (1h,6h,24h,7d,30d) from pages; SignalQueryControls had 4 items (no 30d) — now gets the 5th for free
4. Used explicit `{ value: string; label: string }[]` types instead of `as const` for Select-compatible constants (MONTHS, COMMON_TIMEZONES, NUMERIC_OPERATORS, BOOL_OPERATORS, DAYS_OPTIONS, CONDITION_TYPES) — avoids readonly incompatibility with Select component's `SelectOption[]` prop
5. Kept `as const` on DAYS (string literal tuple) and TIME_RANGE_PRESETS (not passed to Select)
6. ConditionBuilder re-exports CONDITION_TYPES from @/lib/constants for backward compatibility

